# Generated MCP manifest artifacts — emitted with LF by `npm run manifest`. Pin
# LF on disk (regardless of core.autocrlf) so the drift guard in
# test/manifest.test.ts is byte-identical on every platform; otherwise a Windows
# checkout would store CRLF and the guard would fail against the LF generator output.
manifest.json text eol=lf
MANIFEST.md text eol=lf
bundle/manifest.json text eol=lf
